@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #ffffff

title 进房信令全流程（/rtc WebSocket）

participant "浏览器\nlivekit-client JS" as JS
participant "RTC Service\nservice/rtcservice.go" as RTC
participant "RoomManager\nservice/roommanager.go" as RM
participant "Room\nrtc/room.go" as ROOM
participant "Participant\nrtc/participant.go" as P

== 前提：业务侧已签发 JWT ==
JS -> RTC : GET /rtc?access_token=JWT\n(WebSocket 升级)
RTC -> RTC : 校验 JWT grants\n(video.room / roomJoin / canPublish)
RTC -> RM : 定位或创建房间
RM -> ROOM : getOrCreateRoom(roomName)
JS -> RTC : SignalRequest{ join,\n participantInit: 身份/权限/\n publisherOffer(SDP) }
RTC -> ROOM : JoinParticipant()
ROOM -> P : 创建 Participant\n(JOINING → JOINED)
ROOM --> RTC : JoinResponse{ 房间信息,\n 其他参与者列表, ICE servers,\n pingInterval=5s, pingTimeout=15s }
RTC --> JS : SignalResponse{ join }
== ICE/DTLS 握手 ==
JS <-> P : ICE trickle 候选交换\n(STUN/UDP mux)
JS <-> P : DTLS 握手 → SRTP 密钥派生
P -> P : 媒体 transport 状态 connected
P -> ROOM : 状态 ACTIVE
ROOM --> JS : participant update\n(state=ACTIVE)
== 保活（全生命周期） ==
loop 每 5 秒
  JS -> RTC : SignalRequest{ ping }
  RTC --> JS : SignalResponse{ pong }
end
note over JS, RTC : 15 秒无 ping 判死\n服务端踢掉 participant\n（排障时用于识别僵尸连接）
@enduml
